{"word":"ὀρθῶς","uri":"orthôs","senses":[{"word":"ὀρθῶς","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ὀρθῶς,</span></span> <span class=\"ital\">adv.</span> dans le\ndroit sens, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d. :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> avec rectitude, avec\njustesse (penser, <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">999 ;</span> parler,\n<span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ch.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">526,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) ;\n<span class=\"grec\">ὀρθῶς ἔλεξας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Att.</span> tu as dit correctement, <span class=\"ital\">c. à\nd.</span> tu as raison ; <span class=\"ital\">dans les\nréponses,</span> tout droit, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span>\nprécisément, justement, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Prot.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">559</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὀρθῶς ἔχει,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Prot.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">338</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, il est bien de,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec\nl’inf.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> selon le droit, selon la\njustice, <span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Areop.</span> <span class=\"refch\">§ 28,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> avec vérité,\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">403 ;</span> véritablement : <span class=\"grec\">ὁ ὀρθῶς κυϐερνήτης,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">341</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, le vrai\npilote.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ὀρθός</span>.</div>\n"}]}